# warnings

## MODULE_LEVEL_DIRECTIVE

```text
[MODULE_LEVEL_DIRECTIVE] The semantics of the module level directive "use client" in "main.js" may not be preserved when bundling.
   ╭─[ main.js:1:1 ]
   │
 1 │ 'use client';
   │ ──────┬──────  
   │       ╰──────── module level directive may not be preserved
   │ 
   │ Help: For more information, see https://rolldown.rs/in-depth/directives#other-directives
───╯

```

